"2026-03-01T09:09:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.7.dev 634220e9f\n- Reproducible in: v4.6-stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (634220e9f) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8180) - AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 63.11 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the `Script` tab if a script and either the `Animation` or `Shader Editor` dock is open the controls are \"pushed out\" at the bottom of the screen. Can probably be avoided by reducing the minimum size of the docks.\n\n<img width=\"600\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b82c905-c230-49f9-9f88-243cbdc50cff\" />\n\n<img width=\"600\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f739bf6-c4dc-4304-8041-6d21c0d1573a\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open any project\n- Make the editor as small as possible\n- Select the `Script` tab\n- Open any script and select either `Animation` or `Shader Editor` dock\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nHappens in a new project","closed_by":{"login":"TheDying0fLight","id":95179191,"node_id":"U_kgDOBaxRtw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95179191?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDying0fLight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDying0fLight/starre